<view class="page">

  <view class="topbar">
    <view class="tb-title">我的课堂</view>
    <text class="tb-tip">小程序仅查看与入口，上课请用电脑浏览器</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{fatal}}" class="fatal">{{fatal}}</view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="tip">加载中…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{!groups.length}}" class="empty">
    <view class="empty-glyph">🎓</view>
    <view>{{role === 'teacher' ? '暂无排期' : '暂无可用课堂'}}</view>
    <view class="empty-sub">课堂由排期产生：有排期后这里会出现每个课次。</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="group" wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="scheduleId" wx:for-item="g">
      <view class="g-head">
        <text class="g-name">{{g.courseName}}</text>
        <text class="g-sub">{{g.sub}}</text>
      </view>

      <view class="ins" wx:for="{{g.instances}}" wx:key="key" wx:for-item="it">
        <view class="ins-line">
          <text class="ins-title">{{it.title}}</text>
          <text class="ins-state tone-{{it.tone}}">{{it.stateText}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="ins-time">{{it.timeText}}</view>
        <view class="ins-ops">
          <text class="op ghost" data-key="{{it.key}}" bindtap="onCopyLink">复制链接</text>
          <text
            wx:for="{{it.actions}}" wx:key="action" wx:for-item="a"
            class="op {{a.action === 'enter' ? 'primary' : ''}}"
            data-action="{{a.action}}" data-key="{{it.key}}" data-name="{{g.courseName}}"
            bindtap="onAction">{{a.label}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view class="footnote">
    点「进入课堂」会提示在电脑上打开，并复制课堂链接。课堂需要摄像头、麦克风与屏幕共享，
    这些能力只有浏览器具备，小程序无法替代。
  </view>
</view>
